  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In Electrolytic refining, the pure metal is used as cathode and impure metal is used as anode. Electrolytic refining of aluminium is called Hall-Heroult process.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>AlF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is added during electrolysis of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;to lower the melting point and increase conductivity.<br />Reactions at cathode and anode are as follows:<br />Cathode:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Al</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>melt</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Al</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Anode:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>melt</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>CO</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>melt</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
